<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1"><strong>=F0=9F=92=AD M=
ental Model: Custom Hook Communication Patterns</strong></h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Pattern Classification</=
strong>:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Event-Based Communicati=
on</strong> (Loose coupling)
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Event bus hooks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">PubSub patterns</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Good for: Cross-tree communicat=
ion, plugin architectures</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Shared State Communicat=
ion</strong> (Direct coupling)
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Shared state hooks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Global state management</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Good for: Synchronized data, co=
ordinated updates</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Context-Based Communica=
tion</strong> (Tree-scoped coupling)
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Custom context hooks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Provider pattern enhancement</l=
i>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Good for: Feature-specific stat=
e, bounded contexts</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Imperative Communicatio=
n</strong> (Ref-based)
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Imperative handle hooks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Action-based APIs</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Good for: Component control, an=
imations, integrations</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
